,450/day.\n\nHandysize: HS7TC avg improved by 0.2k/day at USD 9,844/day. Skaw-Passero trip to Boston- Galveston pays 0.3k/day more at USD 7,636/day, Brazil to Cont. pays 0.2k/day less at USD 14,650/ day, S.E. Asia trip to Spore/Japan is firmer at USD 9,650/day, China/S.Korea/Japan round trip is at USD 10,181/day, and trip from U.S. Gulf to Cont. is increased by 0.1k/day at USD 10,843/day, while N.China-S.Korea-Japan trip to S.E.Asia is increased by 0.3k/day at USD 9,731/day. 38K Handy 1y T/C rate is up this week at USD 12,250/day while 32k Handy 1y T/C is softer at USD 10,300/day in Atlantic and USD 10,200/day in Pacific region.",
