ic Basket earnings are improved by 0.4k/day at USD 19,046/ day. The MR route from Rotterdam to New York (TC2) is softer by 0.1k/day at USD 22,698/day, (TC6) Intermed (Algeria to Euro Med) earnings are firmer by.5k/day at USD 18,277/day, (TC14) US Gulf to Cont is up by 0.5k/day at USD 10,779/day, (TC18) US Gulf to Brazil earnings are higher by 0.5k/day at USD 19,895/day, (TC23) Am- sterdam to Le Havre is lower at USD 18,414/day while Yeosu to Botany Bay (TC22) is firmer by 0.5k/day at USD 29,092/day and ARA to West Africa (TC19) is down by 0.4k/day at USD 15,573/day. Eco LR2 1y T/C rate is higher than previous week at USD 31,750/day, while Eco MR2 1y T/C rate is increased on a weekly basis at USD 22,000/day."
